; The example with the edit doc/manual/baselines.md makes to show a stale
; expectation: the report reads its rows instead of processing them.
; Built, never run as a test; the page's transcripts run it. The test file
; is a copy, so a failure block can print its source line, and runtest
; keeps it equal to the example's.

(executable
 (name test_mytool)
 (modules test_mytool mytool)
 (libraries windtrap))

(rule
 (alias runtest)
 (action
  (diff test_mytool.ml ../test_mytool.ml)))
